        "TileImage": "$($repository 2862473f-7c5d-4206-b283-c51eb5a0beae).Image",
        "Description": "The Don is indulging himself with the taste of victory again, thanks to you. The rebelion is abolished and his seat is secure. More than that, he now sees himself as the new druglord of the continent. That is why he issued another contract for you. Get rid of the current ringleader, Rico Delgado, to secure that position for your family and your Don.\rSo no one would suspect our involvement, you must take out his mistresses and his two top lieutenants.\rHappy hunting.",
